@startuml
skinparam TitleFontSize 20
title NVMe-oF/RDMA over Falcon — RETRIEVE (Read) Flow

' ─── IPU HOST (initiator side) ──────────────────────────────────
box "<size:18><b>IPU host (initiator)</b></size>" #F0F6FF
participant "Application\n(LMCache)" as APP
participant "NVMe-oF Initiator\n(nvme_rdma on Xeon)" as INIT
participant "Initiator IPU\n(Falcon / irdma verbs)" as IFAL
end box

' ─── KV Cache node (target side) ────────────────────────────────
box "<size:18><b>KV Cache node (target)</b></size>" #FFF8E8
participant "Target IPU\n(Falcon / irdma verbs)" as TFAL
participant "Target Xeon\n(nvmet-rdma + block layer)" as CPU
participant "Target DRAM" as TDDR
participant "NVMe SSD\n(namespace)" as SSD
end box

APP -> INIT: retrieve(tokens); L1 miss, key→LBA hit
INIT -> INIT: Register RX MR; build SGL\npointing at initiator buffer
INIT -> IFAL: SEND (NVMe READ command capsule + SGL)
IFAL -> TFAL: Falcon reliable transport\n(wire)
TFAL -> CPU: Deliver NVMe-oF command\n(nvmet-rdma dispatch)

CPU -> SSD: NVMe READ
SSD --> TDDR: DMA payload into target DRAM
SSD --> CPU: Completion

CPU -> TFAL: Post RDMA WRITE\n(target DRAM → initiator RX MR)
TFAL -> IFAL: Falcon reliable transport\n(wire, RDMA WRITE push)
IFAL --> INIT: Payload placed in RX MR;\nCQE observed

CPU -> TFAL: SEND (NVMe completion capsule)
TFAL -> IFAL: Falcon reliable transport\n(wire, SEND)
IFAL --> INIT: Completion capsule received

INIT -> APP: NVMe command complete;\nBLAKE3 verify → deliver from MR

note over IFAL, TFAL
  Boundary: Falcon RDMA link (100 GbE, MTU 4096).
  Both IPUs do fabric offload only — no NVMe logic.
end note

note over CPU, SSD
  Standard nvmet-rdma read path.
  Target-issued RDMA WRITE places payload directly into
  the initiator's pre-registered RX MR; no host-side
  post-completion transfer step (unlike NVMe/TCP C2H PDUs).
end note
@enduml
